WEBVTT

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:31.350
What's taking you guys so long?!
Why do you have to walk so slow?!

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.660
What are you getting mad for, Taito?

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.330
It's going to be a long journey;
we'll get exhausted if we start rushing now.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:40.460
Shut up! What if that
mustached bastard gets away

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.170
while you're sitting around
saying stuff like that?!

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:45.770
Please calm down, Sir Taito.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:48.540
We're talking about
a general of the Xian Empire.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.870
Just where would he run away to?

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.780
Wh-where? Well...

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.210
S-some place I don't know!

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.310
Now you're just being defiant.

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:00.550
Something wrong with that?!
Something wrong with that?!

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:01.880
Don't repeat yourself!

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:06.490
There is nothing to fear.
We will find Keiro at the capital.

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:10.560
Especially if that is the karma of the stars.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:15.160
However, I do not think you can
defeat Keiro at your current strength.

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.800
What?!

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:20.970
H-hey, wait! I only lost because
he caught me off guard!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:23.010
In a real fight, I'd beat that guy easy!

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:30.310
Would you be willing to hear me out?
We can hurry ahead after that if you'd like.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:33.340
And as long as we're here,
let's wash off the sweat of the road!

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:53.900
So, what do you have to tell me?

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:57.910
Do you know the Eight Great Styles?

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.340
Of course I do!

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:03.350
Then please name the eight parts.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:11.750
Okay! The fist. The staff. Rope, bow,
spear, sword. And then there's...

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:14.020
Huh? That's only six.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:17.430
Come to think of it, yeah.
You would expect there to be eight...

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:20.030
It isn't surprising that you don't know.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.860
The remaining two are known
as Energy Manipulation.

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.900
Energy Manipulation?

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:32.810
Yes. Technically, there <i>are</i> two types of it,
but one has died out because no one uses it.

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:37.380
Hold on! I don't wanna hear you
spout off trivia you know!

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:41.710
What does that have to do with me not
being able to beat that mustached bastard?!

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.290
W-wow...!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.990
<i>This</i> is Energy Manipulation.

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:56.800
That wasn't much, given
that this is just cloth, but...

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:03.740
Rumor has it Keiro is the greatest
Energy Manipulation user alive.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:09.580
If you cannot at least control the flow of
your own energy, you do not stand a chance.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.780
That is what I am trying to say.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.850
Energy Manipulation!
Energy Manipulation!

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:19.650
He is so dumb...

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:29.600
Wow! What a big boat!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:34.370
<i>It's the Wo Jin Squad</i>... <i>To think that</i>
<i>they've come to such a rural port</i>...

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:45.880
Wow!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:50.450
This is amazing, Taito!
Look at all the shops and buildings!

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.690
Look at how imposing that rock is!

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:58.560
Yeah. But... there's something
exhausted and weak about this place.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.300
Yeah, now that you mention it...

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:08.900
I've heard that imperial officials continually
exploit this town to fill their own pockets.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.810
Perhaps that is one reason why.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.310
Officials?!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.010
Now I see!

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:17.910
The Qing Long guys <i>did</i> talk about

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:21.050
how officials have been doing whatever
they please in the capital and in the country

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:25.820
ever since the new child emperor
acceded to the throne...

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.160
Damn it!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:31.860
That mustached bastard,
the kid emperor, the officials!

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:34.060
The empire is nothing but a bunch of ass--

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.530
Taito! Not so loud!

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:40.340
I will search for lodging for the night.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:44.710
Why don't you two enjoy yourselves
and have a look around the boat?

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:48.280
--You don't mind?!
--You're so understanding, Ryuko!

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:49.380
Okay, see you later!

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:50.680
Absolutely not!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.780
There's no way at all?!

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:56.020
C'mon, just for a minute!
Let us see the inside of the boat!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.020
Stubborn kid!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:00.590
The likes of you would never
be allowed on the Dou Ya,

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:02.690
the ship of the glorious Wo Jin Squad!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.130
Wo Jin Squad, Floating Pod, whatever!

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:07.730
Just c'mon! Please?!

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:09.060
Taito...

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.440
Are you okay?! Little Sister Laila!

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:21.070
Curses! Your sickness will just not go away!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:27.420
Listen, Big Brother...
I have just one favor to ask...

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:29.250
What is it?! Tell me!

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:35.960
I want to see the inside of that ship...
Just once, before I die...

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:42.400
Okay! I understand! I will ask
that nice Mr. Sailor for you now!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.070
So... Are we still not allowed on?

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.060
Of course you aren't!

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.270
Damn cheapskate.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:53.070
My acting was perfect, too...

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:55.100
Sir Taito. Lady Laila.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.580
I've found lodging.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.920
This place?!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.820
Ryuko! There were better places than this!

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:08.920
When it comes to lodging, staying
out of the night dew is all that matters.

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:11.320
What do <i>you</i> people want?!

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:17.270
These are my two companions
I mentioned, Ma'am.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.800
We would like to stay the night.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:21.700
Oh. I see.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:24.170
Oh, yes.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:29.380
It looks like tonight will be chilly
from the rain, so I left you an extra blanket.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.550
Thank you very much.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:34.680
Is she... a nice person?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.120
I guess so...?

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:48.700
To think that Sir Koyo, the head of the world-
renowned Wo Jin Squad would stay here!

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:53.790
Working even in such a rural
port town has its benefits!

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:57.140
Don't be silly.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:02.640
You're guaranteed to make it big
when you return to the capital, Sir Oen.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:07.080
I should have come to see you much sooner.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:09.820
Just as I would expect
from the Sir Koyo who leads

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.320
the great warriors of the Wo Jin
Squad at such a young age!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.820
You're quite a flatterer!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.760
It is not flattery.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:20.560
We water bandits must read
the tide of the times to make a living.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:25.930
If a military officer is the next to conquer
the capital, it will be Lord Keiro.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:28.370
And if it is a civilian...

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.270
What a delightful night!

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:36.550
Hey! Bring even more food for Sir Koyo!

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:38.100
Of course!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.680
Now then, Sir Oen.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:44.280
Allow me to entertain you with a trick.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.190
Please forgive my crudeness.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.230
No, splendidly done!

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:56.430
Did you see that, Korin?

00:07:56.430 --> 00:08:01.070
The great Koyo of the Wo Jin Squad
humbly performed a trick for me.

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:06.710
Yes! To think a renowned master
would lower himself that much!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:10.910
I guess it's because those
with power cannot be ignored.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:12.150
Indeed.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:15.950
I will need much money
once I return to the capital.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:21.390
I need to squeeze as much money out of
these people as I can while I'm in this town...

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:39.070
Can't sleep?

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:45.510
If you want to practice your martial arts,
you can avoid the rain in the backyard.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.850
Use it as you please.

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:51.790
I guess she <i>is</i> nice after all?

00:08:56.630 --> 00:09:02.130
<i>Energy Manipulation begins with being</i>
<i>conscious of the flow of energy in the body</i>.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:04.500
<i>Gather that energy in the right hand</i>...

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.690
...<i>and instantly release it into a weapon!</i>

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:15.480
Huh? That's weird.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.880
Again!

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:19.980
Huh?

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:22.850
Transfer the energy into the weapon only.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:28.560
You are pouring the energy into
your own body instead of your weapon.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:32.830
The secret to Energy Manipulation is in
how you transfer the energy to the weapon.

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:37.900
B-but how am I supposed to
transfer energy into this?

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:41.740
Learning it is the only way
you can beat Keiro!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:43.800
That mustached bastard...

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.540
Again!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:53.050
<i>You've already used Energy</i>
<i>Manipulation, Sir Taito</i>.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:57.920
<i>If you stay unawakened,</i>
<i>the land will remain at peace</i>.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:02.250
<i>But will the karma of the stars</i>
<i>allow it to be that way?</i>

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.270
Whoa, there are so many of 'em!

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:19.010
I'd expect no less from the Xuan Lang
Platoon, led by Imperial General Keiro!

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:21.010
The big man sleeps nice and sound in town

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.450
while the poor subordinates
live in the freezing cold...

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.780
That's so sad!

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:29.010
Well, guess I'll go prowl
around the weapons depot!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.350
Taito! Get up! Get up!

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.100
I said get up!

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.230
Oww!

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:45.200
We can't leave town?

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:50.370
The river has swelled due to the rain.
We're stuck until the water recedes.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:52.810
Oh...

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:56.280
Well, I can just consider it a good
chance to get in some training!

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:58.880
What are you talking about, dumb brother?

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.550
All you've done is sleep
and snore and nothing else!

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:02.880
Shut up!

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.220
I'm coming in.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:10.060
Hello, Ma'am. Do you need something?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:14.090
It's hard to see from any other room than this.

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:25.240
Pardon my manners.
Shall I bring you some more tea?

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.940
O-okay...

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:34.840
That rock is called the "Holy Bear."
It's the guardian deity of this town.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:41.820
It was because of the great bear's presence
that our town hasn't suffered very much

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:45.690
even during times of war and famine.

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:50.130
But the officials from the capital have
forbidden us from worshipping anything

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:54.640
other than what the empire decrees.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.040
That's terrible!

00:11:56.040 --> 00:12:02.970
At this rate, something bad is certain
to happen. Something dreadful...

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:10.220
Then you guys should kick those
officials out! Stand up to them!

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:12.650
Old lady! Are you here?! Old lady!

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:15.360
What?!

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:22.230
That great bear has sat there for centuries!
Rain like this can't do anything to it!

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:27.300
This is no time for denial! The town
will be destroyed once the bear falls!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:31.540
But where can we flee to in this rain?

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:35.680
Are you saying this is the great bear's wrath?

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:37.050
Wh-what should we do?

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:41.520
There's nothing <i>to</i> do.
We must evacuate immediately too.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.050
But what about all the townspeople?!

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:48.490
A place to run to... A place where
the townspeople can also escape to...

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:51.260
That's it!

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:53.430
The lives of the townspeople are on the line!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:54.430
Please!

00:12:54.430 --> 00:13:00.200
I said no! I don't care if some rocks
fall or not; I can't let anyone past here!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.670
Then we'll talk to your boss directly!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:04.610
Please! Let us see him!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.410
The boss would never bother
with the likes of you!

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:10.340
Now get the hell out before you get hurt!

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:12.610
Damn you!

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:18.590
How dare you...!

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:20.960
There's no time to explain
the situation to small fries!

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.460
Just let me see your boss!

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.190
Like hell we will, you brat!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.230
What are you doing?

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:29.800
That many people ganging up on a kid
will ruin the name of the Wo Jin Squad.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:31.530
B-but, Boss...!

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:33.520
I'm telling you to leave!

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:38.270
You're the head of this ship?

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:40.580
I'm Koyo. And you are...?

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.310
I'm Taito.

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:46.480
Apparently this rain is going to cause
that big rock to fall onto the town!

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:50.750
Please! Let the townspeople
seek shelter on your ship!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:52.750
Please! There's no time left!

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.750
Move aside! Move aside!

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:00.630
Sorry to keep you waiting, Sir Koyo!

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:03.900
Oh, Sir Oen. You've certainly arrived quickly.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:07.440
Yes. It's a race against time, you see.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:12.130
Now, then! Carry my treasure
onto the ship! No dawdling!

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:16.480
We truly appreciate the help, Sir Koyo!

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.810
Someday I will reward you handsomely!

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.910
Those words alone honor me.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:28.620
Wha--?! Hold on!
Let the townspeople get on too!

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:32.290
Who is this runt, Sir Koyo?

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:37.700
Apparently, he wants me to let the people
of that town board my ship as well...

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:42.300
Don't be stupid! The ship is at full
capacity now that we're onboard!

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:45.640
What happens to the lowly
commoners is of no concern to me!

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.140
What did you say?!

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:52.980
Isn't that what you would want anyway?
Being crushed by the very thing you believe in...

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.780
Taito! Where are you going?!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:06.790
Just look, Sir Koyo!

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:11.800
This treasure is my pride and joy!
It is the symbol of my power!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:14.870
Yes. But it's odd.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:17.240
I don't see the valuable
Holy Bear Jewel anywhere...

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.810
Holy Bear... Jewel?

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:27.220
Yes. According to our investigations,
it was hidden here by a previous official.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:31.820
Don't tell me you haven't
dug it up yet, Sir Oen?!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.320
Hurry! Hurry!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:37.190
We really must thank Koyo!

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:38.690
Absolutely!

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:44.530
To think that such a treasure was sleeping
beneath the very mansion we live in!

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:49.500
It's raining much more
heavily than we expected.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.510
Hey! Girl!

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.910
Hurry them up. There's no time to waste.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.620
This is a load of crap!

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:06.450
Only the rotten bastards get to survive
while the innocent people die?!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:08.550
That's a load of crap!

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:14.520
So don't fall, old bear!
Hold on just a little longer!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.520
I said stop!

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:21.440
Sir Taito.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:25.570
You really are as unfathomably
stupid as Laila says.

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:26.610
Ryuko!

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:31.100
Did you really think you could
stop this all by yourself?

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:37.550
Look hard! Whoever
finds it will get a reward!

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:40.540
Treasure! Treasure! <i>My</i> treasure!

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:44.460
You done, Ryuko?!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:47.160
All finished, Sir Taito!

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:49.600
That should hold now.

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:54.430
Assuming the rain doesn't
get heavier, anyway...

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:57.230
Ryuko!

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:02.770
S-Sir Taito!

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:13.960
Sir Taito! Please let go! I will be fine!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:18.860
Forget it! Not even you can get away
clean from a fall from this height!

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:22.100
But at this rate, we'll both be killed!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.430
Please let go!

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.670
Let go of me!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.270
Let go, Taito!

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.100
I refuse to!

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:35.840
You may be my watchdog... but you
told me we would go to the capital together!

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:38.150
We're comrades!

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:43.150
Besides, you came all the way
out here to help me!

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:46.890
So I absolutely refuse to abandon you now!

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:48.690
I refuse to!

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:50.680
T-Taito...

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:55.330
The Alkaid pattern!

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:06.240
I thank you...

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:08.670
Don't be stupid. It was nothing!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.860
--The rock!
--Great bear!

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.700
Sir Oen! The rock...!

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.030
What?!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.580
I'm sorry we couldn't protect the town...

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:53.090
Don't be silly. You did very well.

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:58.960
The houses and buildings may have been
demolished, but everyone is still alive.

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:04.770
We will simply treasure the
great bear in its new form now.

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:10.870
But why did the head of that ship
suddenly decide to help everyone?

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.360
Who knows...

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:22.280
To think he would go back to be crushed
while looking for a treasure that doesn't exist!

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:25.320
It's too bad the guy had to be so greedy!

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:28.460
Coming to this rural port was worth it!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:32.930
The only issue was that the Holy Bear
came down sooner than anticipated.

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:36.660
That boy's actions cancelled it out.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:40.430
Taito, huh? I'll be sure to remember you!

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:47.140
At last, we can head for the capital again!

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:51.510
What are you talking about?
We were only stuck there for one day.

00:19:51.510 --> 00:19:54.650
Shut up! That was a long day!

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:58.790
Come. Let's not dawdle, Taito.

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:00.960
Wait, Ryuko!

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:04.530
Just "Taito" instead of "Sir Taito"?

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:07.930
What happened to reaching
the capital as quickly as possible?

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.660
You're one to talk!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:14.670
Well, whatever.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.170
Wait for me!

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:26.780
<i>The stars begin to move</i>.
<i>Led by karma, they meet</i>.

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:29.610
<i>Five Divine Warriors? I dunno</i>
<i>what you're talking about!</i>

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:32.420
<i>I'm only trying to do what my master said!</i>

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:35.820
<i>I don't know why,</i>
<i>but I smell stupidity in the air</i>.

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:40.660
<i>If you are to join the Dubhe,</i>
<i>then I will destroy you with all my might</i>.

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:46.660
<i>The boy with the Phecda pattern</i>...
<i>Is he friend or foe?</i>

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:50.460
<i>On Hero Tales,</i>
<i>"Chapter Four: Divine Warrior."</i>

00:21:01.680 --> 00:21:04.110
<i>Stay away from Laila!</i>
